!.env.example
# Local fork deployments are regenerated on every `nix run .#dev`; the public
# Base Sepolia record is tracked (it is what the subgraph indexes).
# Anchored: a pattern with an inner slash matches from the repo root only, so
# plain `deployments/local.json` would silently miss this path.
contracts/deployments/local.json
app/public/local.json
contracts/broadcast/
contracts/cache/
